 nderstanding of backend data flow and ability to run simple database queri
 es for data verification.\n  *   Test Artifacts: Design\, execute\, and ma
 intain test cases and automation scripts based on complex business and tec
 hnical requirements.\n  *   Defect Management: Identify\, log\, and track 
